# Ball_Thunder - yellow ball with a white-hot lightning bolt decal.
# Ball family structure (see Ball_Basic.paint); the ramp is the UI gold ramp pushed to the ball's lemon yellow.
size 32 32
key
  K #4a1c14  ink (outer line)
  k #82401a  outline on the lit side
  M #ffd81c  ball base (icons.json color)
  s #eea21e  shadow / reflected light, and the bolt's cast shadow
  S #b8621c  core shadow
  H #fffbe0  highlight and the bolt
strokes
  ellipse K 16 16 14.8 14.8
seeds
  M 16 16
ops
  band M s 1 1 7
  band M S 1 1 3
  band M s 1 1 1
# the bolt: an upper blade leaning right, a jog out to the right, a spike tapering down-left; the
# ball takes a 1 px shadow right of and under its edges (the decal is embossed, not outlined); the tip
# that crosses the shadow crescent turns lemon (the bolt in shade)
shade at 9 8
  ......HHHHHs
  ......HHHHs.
  .....HHHHHs.
  .....HHHHs..
  ....HHHHHs..
  ....HHHHs...
  ...HHHHHHHHH
  ...HHHHHHHHs
  ...ssssHHHs.
  ......HHHHs.
  ......HHHs..
  .....HHHHs..
  .....HHHs...
  ....HHMs....
  ....MMs.....
  ....Ms......
shade at 6 5
  ....HH
  ..HHHH
  .HHHH.
  .HH...
ops
  edge K k -1 -1
  px k 2 19 19 2
  px K 3 23 23 3
